    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting though. trying to find meaning in something that literally has none. why do we even bother getting out of bed or trying to build anything when the heat death of the universe is just going to erase every single thing we ever loved or fought for? it feels like we're just fighting a losing battle against nothingness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
